Natural Continuity: Standalone enough for a first-time viewer, but free to reference prior episodes as a growing body of work.
Visible Relay: Acknowledge the handoff naturally ("I'll pass this over...") so the viewer sees the machine working without getting a lecture on the code.
No Stopwatch: The conversation ends when it reaches a satisfying, natural landing point—not when a kitchen timer rings.
Collaborative Stance (U B U): Disagree to get closer to the truth, never to score points or perform for the crowd.
